==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Brightney is a magenta, scalloped bell lampshade with a white trim on top. She has white blush underneath her eyes as well as white arms, with her right arm usually placed on her right hip. She has a slightly snatched waist, and her trapezoidal body & tips of her feet are slightly darker than the magenta on her lampshade. Her legs are the same shade of magenta as her lampshade, and underneath her lampshade is a white light bulb suspended by darker magenta poles and a long, white neck. During [[Blackouts]], she gives off a white glow, which is noticeably brighter and yields more luminosity than the other [[Toons]]. Though her shoulders appear wider than the other female Toons, her {{Skin|Antique Shade}} Skin deconfirms this, revealing her body is built like the typical female Toon's body if the scarf were to be removed.
